{"id":"wb-7-1481","name":"宏佛塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宏佛塔","text":"宏佛塔，俗称王澄塔，位于中华人民共和国宁夏回族自治区银川市贺兰县，始建时间不详，从塔内文物及原塔用砖可以判断为西夏晚期时所建。1990年至1992年，宏佛塔经过大规模的重修。2013年，宏佛塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8F%E4%BD%9B%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86801155,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86801155","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a2e84fc32c7002dd72471354.jpg","title":"宏佛塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%8F%E4%BD%9B%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2b/%E5%AE%8F%E4%BD%9B%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​宏佛塔全景照","width":320,"height":432}}